Icons from the Oxygen icon theme (KDE, oxygen-icons5), LGPL-3.0-or-later.
Source: https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/oxygen-icons5
Regenerate with tools/oxygen-icons.py.
media-cdrom is Oxygen's media-optical, internet-web-browser its applications-internet (a plain globe), system-installer its
package-x-generic and emblem-favorite its rating (a star). fluxos.png is the fluxOS logo (assets/fluxos-logo.png),
not part of Oxygen. wave.png is the Wave browser icon, rendered from
assets/wave.svg (user-supplied artwork), also not part of Oxygen.
